# buttons and the knobs: a held button (1.5: no cards) acts when let go; SAVE held on goes back to the recipe;
# a few quick clicks are exact, a quick spin sweeps
# the title (ZENITH-1, by Polystellarflow) first: a button during it only skips it
wait 4000
wait 300
expect par0 64
press REC
wait 1000
release REC
wait 200
expect frozen 1
tap REC
wait 200
expect frozen 0
tap ENV
turn K1 3 10
expect par0 67
wait 500
turn K1 -3 30
expect par0 64
wait 500
turn K1 -12 10
expect par0 0
wait 500
turn K1 2 100
expect par0 2
wait 1500
press SAVE
wait 1700
release SAVE
wait 200
expect par0 64
tap SEL
turn K2 1 80
wait 100
shot space_turning.png
# HOME + SELECT: the tempo, from any page
press HOME
turn SELECT 3 100
release HOME
expect par18 69
expect view 15
# HOME, HOME, HOME: the Garden, the Journey, the picture; any button wakes the pages
tap HOME
expect view 0
tap HOME
expect view 1
tap HOME
wait 500
expect pic 1
shot picture.png
tap SEL
wait 100
expect pic 0
expect view 0
# EDIT: the next part; held, RANDOM (its card first)
tap EDIT
press EDIT
wait 1700
release EDIT
wait 100
# the pages, each button's in turn
tap SEL
expect view 15
tap SEL
expect view 16
tap SEL
expect view 17
tap SEL
expect view 15
tap FX
expect view 18
shot fxmenu.png
# FX again: back to the page it came from
tap FX
expect view 15
tap FX
expect view 18
tap GLO
tap GLO
expect view 20
tap GLO
expect view 21
tap GLO
expect view 22
tap GLO
expect view 19
# nothing touched for 30 s: the picture by itself; a knob: the pages
wait 31000
expect pic 1
turn K1 1
expect pic 0
